# Manual Subagent Invocation

- Do not auto-launch the `backend`, `frontend`, or `contract` subagents.
- Only run these subagents when the user explicitly asks for them (or clearly approves).
- Handle tasks directly yourself by default; prefer asking for confirmation before delegating.
